      <title>清仓数据中心股后立即加仓两只防御股，AI暴露正被主动压降</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260902/%E6%B8%85%E4%BB%93%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E8%82%A1%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E5%8A%A0%E4%BB%93%E4%B8%A4%E5%8F%AA%E9%98%B2%E5%BE%A1%E8%82%A1AI%E6%9A%B4%E9%9C%B2%E6%AD%A3%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E5%8E%8B%E9%99%8D/</link>
